        ],
        "columns": [
          {
            "id": "studio-pulse-shorts-8",
            "contents": [
              {
                "id": "studio-pulse-shorts-9",
                "type": "text",
                "values": {
                  "anchor": "",
                  "displayCondition": null,
                  "selectable": true,
                  "draggable": true,
                  "duplicatable": true,
                  "deletable": true,
                  "hideable": true,
                  "_meta": {
                    "htmlID": "u_content_text_2",
                    "htmlClassNames": "u_content_text"
                  },
                  "linkStyle": {
                    "inherit": true,
                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "Hi {{first_name}},<br><br>I’ve just got back from my local film festival, where I try to see as many films as I can in a week. This year I managed nine, and my head feels better for it.<br><br>Working in brands, and just being a person, I think it matters to take in a wide range of things. When everyone’s inputs come from the same place, it’s easy to mistake copying for success.<br><br>I’ve been thinking about this since a drinks brand from a well-known founder <a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#5A3A8A;\">announced it was closing</a> less than two years after launch. Everything about it, from the packaging to the social media, felt familiar. It looked like a successful drinks brand. But was it?<br><br>Tell me what you think by replying to this email.<br><br>Happy reading,<br>Jo from Pulse ✌",
                  "fontSize": "13px",
                  "fontFamily": {
                    "label": "Helvetica",
                    "value": "helvetica,sans-serif"
                  },
                  "color": "#1A1A1A",
                  "textAlign": "left",
                  "lineHeight": "160%",
                  "containerPadding": "24px 40px"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "studio-pulse-shorts-10",
                "type": "text",
                "values": {
                  "anchor": "",
                  "displayCondition": null,
