                    "linkColor": "#514293",
                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "<span style=\"display:block;background:#E8E2F5;border-radius:16px;padding:20px 28px\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;color:#5A3A8A\">In this edition:</span><br><br>•&nbsp; A founder-led drinks brand is closing. Our data shows how little it grew.<br>•&nbsp; More people are carrying reusable bottles than ever.<br>•&nbsp; A smart ring is quietly winning over new buyers.</span>",
